        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casper_Mountain"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Casper Mountain is part of the Casper formation, named for the limestones and sandstones found throughout the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casper_Mountain"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A local tradition involves families migrating up Casper Mountain to see actors re-enact stories of witches and warlocks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casper_Mountain"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Hogadon Ski Area on Casper Mountain is one of the few ski resorts with a parking entry point located above the resort.",
